{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"KDE.NeoChat","latestVersion":"26.08.1","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Matrix Client","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://invent.kde.org/network/neochat/-/blob/HEAD/LICENSES/GPL-3.0-only.txt","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Matrix Client","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://invent.kde.org/network/neochat/-/blob/HEAD/LICENSES/GPL-3.0-only.txt","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"NeoChat is a chat app that lets you take full advantage of the Matrix network. It provides you with a secure way to send text messages, videos and audio files to your family, colleagues and friends.\nNeoChat aims to be a fully featured application for the Matrix specification. As such everything in the current stable specification with the notable exceptions of VoIP, threads and some aspects of End-to-End Encryption are supported. There are a few other smaller omissions due to the fact that the Matrix spec is constantly evolving but the aim remains to provide eventual support for the entire spec.\nDue to the nature of the Matrix specification development NeoChat also supports numerous unstable features. Currently these are:\n- Polls - MSC3381\n- Sticker Packs - MSC2545\n- Location Events - MSC3488","name":"NeoChat","packageUrl":"https://apps.kde.org/neochat/","publisher":"KDE e.V.","publisherUrl":"https://kde.org/","tags":["chat","collaborate","collaboration","encrypt","encryption","im","instant-messaging","matrix","message","privacy","riot","secure","security","send","talk"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"Matrix 客户端","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"NeoChat 是一款聊天应用，帮助您充分利用 Matrix 网络，向家人、同事和朋友安全地发送文本信息、视频和音频文件。\nNeoChat 的目标是成为一款功能齐全的 Matrix 规范应用程序。因此，除了 VoIP、线程和端到端加密的某些方面外，当前稳定版规范中的所有功能都得到了支持。由于 Matrix 规范在不断发展，难免还有一些较小的遗漏，但我们的最终目标仍然是支持整个规范。\n由于 Matrix 规范开发的性质，NeoChat 还支持许多不稳定的功能。目前这些功能包括\n- 投票 - MSC3381\n- 贴纸包 - MSC2545\n- 位置事件 - MSC3488","packageUrl":"https://apps.kde.org/zh-cn/neochat/","publisherUrl":"https://kde.org/zh-cn/","tags":[]}},"longDescription":"NeoChat is a chat app that lets you take full advantage of the Matrix network. It provides you with a secure way to send text messages, videos and audio files to your family, colleagues and friends.\nNeoChat aims to be a fully featured application for the Matrix specification. As such everything in the current stable specification with the notable exceptions of VoIP, threads and some aspects of End-to-End Encryption are supported. There are a few other smaller omissions due to the fact that the Matrix spec is constantly evolving but the aim remains to provide eventual support for the entire spec.\nDue to the nature of the Matrix specification development NeoChat also supports numerous unstable features. Currently these are:\n- Polls - MSC3381\n- Sticker Packs - MSC2545\n- Location Events - MSC3488","name":"NeoChat","packageUrl":"https://apps.kde.org/neochat/","publisher":"KDE e.V.","publisherUrl":"https://kde.org/","tags":["chat","collaborate","collaboration","encrypt","encryption","im","instant-messaging","matrix","message","privacy","riot","secure","security","send","talk"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/26.08.1/app.json","detailSha256":"9ddb3a550e51d5638820c87dee2818ad731d471db7170f700d697a564a869439","releaseDate":"2026-09-29","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"26.08.1"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/26.08.0/app.json","detailSha256":"1937f4f34c01c66df5342b2e8ca0d4d851c9bf86cc519e09393e49e22f992081","releaseDate":"2026-09-04","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"26.08.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/26.04.3/app.json","detailSha256":"c0604d2409717b05c77c9a496449420a0b18636deaadf84f71d5e6330d727232","version":"26.04.3"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/26.04.2/app.json","detailSha256":"b3dd7de50190000ade503fec67126a13992cb7d874fdfe76b7d2a6caddffd50e","version":"26.04.2"},{"